event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_023b4950308a9cc7016ac9338573b8819082b4d6270c2be896","output_index":0,"sequence_number":92,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing server-client tests**\n\nI need to implement straightforward and robust server-client tests using the built-in HTTP features in Node. There's ample time for this! I'll set up separate routes for public assets along with the API, and I plan to create an SQLite database at the default path for default data. I'll handle API error codes and ensure that the client uses `textContent` properly. Lastly, I'll consider spawning a temporary environment for the tests. It's all coming together!"}

